        "First create an annotation blank PAC with group means",
        "Then reannotate only tRNA using the PAC_mapper function",
        "or use the provided fasta",
        "map_object <- PAC_mapper(pac_trna, input=ref, N_up = \"NNN\", N_down = \"NNN\",",
